	// ListToolsWithResponse List the callable tools
	//
	// Everything this workspace can do over HTTP, grouped by area, each with its human-readable description, its JSON Schema and its `price` (what one call spends, read live). This is the browsable index: filter by `area`, search by task words (`search=email outreach`, ranked the way the MCP `find_tools` tool ranks), page with a cursor.
	//
	// READ IT, DO NOT HARD-CODE IT. The set grows continuously and a tool absent here is not a missing capability. By default a tool whose connector this workspace has not linked is left out, because it could only ever answer "not connected". Send `include=all` to list EVERY tool, including those: each such row has `available: false`, `unavailable_reason` (`not_connected`, `not_offered` or `shopify_store`), `requires_connector` and a `connect_url` to link it. That is how you build for customers whose accounts are connected to platforms your own test account is not. Calling one of them answers `401` with `error.type: connector_error` and `error.connector`.
	//
